WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.450
A blank editor is scary because

00:00:02.975 --> 00:00:05.125
it has no shape.

00:00:05.125 --> 00:00:06.688
Sketch the parts.

00:00:06.688 --> 00:00:08.588
Split into milestones.

00:00:08.588 --> 00:00:10.763
Finish milestone one.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.100
Plan it.

00:00:12.736 --> 00:00:13.536
Then build it.

00:00:13.536 --> 00:00:14.336
With Placiq.
